# Build-time API base for production builds (`npm run build`).
#
# Vite substitutes VITE_* variables into the bundle at build time - they are not
# read at runtime - so this has to be present when the build runs. Keeping it in
# the repo rather than only in the host's dashboard means a fresh clone builds
# correctly and a mis-typed dashboard variable cannot silently produce a bundle
# that calls its own origin and fails with 404s.
#
# Not a secret: it is the public URL of the API.
# No trailing slash - api.ts builds `${BASE}/api/v1`.
VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://slotsync-ibs2.onrender.com
